<title>USA: Charming Shoppes names CEO Bern chairman.</title>
<headline>Charming Shoppes names CEO Bern chairman.</headline>
<dateline>BENSALEM, Pa. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Charming Shoppes Inc said it appointed its president and chief executive officer, Dorrit Bern, board chairman.</p>
<p>Bern was also vice chairman of the board before she was named chairman, the retail apparel chain said.</p>
<p>The company said Joseph Castle II, the current chairman, will continue as a member of the board.</p>
<p>Charming Shoppes operates 1,134 stores in 44 states under the names &quot;Fashion Bug&quot; and &quot;Fashion Bug Plus.&quot;</p>
</text>
